+# Changelog
+
+All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.
+
+The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.0.0/).
+
+## [Unreleased] — targeting 2.1
+
+### Added
+
+- **`budget` subcommand** (`tally budget --month YYYY-MM`): prints each configured
+  category's spending for the month alongside its monthly budget limit, with a
+  per-row state of `ok`, `warn` (≥ 80 % of budget), or `over`.
+- `report.budget_status(expenses, month)`: core logic that compares a month's
+  category totals against `CATEGORY_BUDGETS` and returns structured rows used by
+  the CLI and tests.
+- `CATEGORY_BUDGETS` mapping and `BUDGET_WARN_RATIO` threshold in `config.py`,
+  giving a single place to tune per-category limits and the warning threshold.
